				\begin{document}$${{{{{\rm{DWPC}}}}}}=\mathop{\sum}_{{{{{{\rm{path}}}}}}\,\in \,{{{{{\rm{Paths}}}}}}}\left(\mathop{\prod}\limits_{d\,\in \,{D}_{{{{{{\rm{path}}}}}}}}{d}^{-W}\right)$$\end{document}DWPC=∑path∈Paths∏d∈Dpathd−W
